  "version": "0.1.0",
  "name": "FIESTA Galaxy workflows — scattering-transform reproductions on Galaxy",
  "description": "Galaxy workflows (gxformat2) that wire the four FIESTA Galaxy tools (foscat-features, foscat-synthesis, planktonclas-inference, scattering-stacking) together to reproduce each FIESTA-OSCARS scattering-transform chain end-to-end: cosmological LSS map synthesis (astro), sea-surface temperature gap-filling on standard and WGS84 HEALPix (sst, sst-wgs84), Decrop et al. 2025 CNN baseline reproduction (decrop), and the bio-stacking chain that combines the CNN softmax with FOSCAT scattering features via a class-weighted logistic-regression meta-classifier. Two-tier verification: planemo smoke tests on synthetic fixtures (Tier 1) and canonical-numbers reproduction on real FIESTA datasets (Tier 2). Designed to be portable to the Galaxy Training Network and WorkflowHub.",
